WEBVTT

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.800
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.410
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.980
who travel the world, searching 
for your ingredients.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.750
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.420
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.490
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.960
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.600
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.080
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.710
With you guys

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.880
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.320
If we join forces

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.320
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:20.930
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.500
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:39.080
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.330
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.160
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.070
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.750
Komatsu is in a Pinch?! Triathlon Cooking!

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:33.500
Now, everybody!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.770
This is the sure to be memorable 
50th Cooking Festival!

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:44.880
The full gathering of all 100 chefs here 
at Cooking Stadium is now complete!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.510
Hey! Aren't you ready yet, Rin?!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.420
The fest has already started!

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:57.590
Gimme a second, hairless!

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:00.460
Taming these guys is hard!

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.960
Taming Beasts is what you do, isn't it?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.260
Those are clones we prepared for today.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.130
Get 'em under control!

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.870
By the way, did you call me handsome...?

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.270
Of course not!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.910
Shige-san,

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.410
we'll be leaving shortly, so...

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:20.040
Yes. Hurry it up.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:25.580
This may well be the last fest.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.990
The stadium is very hot! 
Mostly with excitement...

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.890
In fact, it's like an oven in here!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:43.600
And now, one of the G7 taste masters, as 
elected by IGO leading member nations...

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:48.170
Judge Punch, please give 
us a few delicious words!

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:10.730
In this stadium, we have 100 
representatives of the Gourmet Age.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:16.400
These chefs who should be considered 
world treasures have gathered here today.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:21.140
And among them are chefs who are 
participating for the first time.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.910
Though it's their first time, we at IGO...

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.310
Komatsu!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:26.180
Good luck!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:33.150
I'm looking forward to seeing how they 
do in battle with the top-ranking chefs.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:37.220
And I'll be feasting my eyes on

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.990
the battles of those same top-ranking chefs.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.190
What an incredible lineup...

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:45.630
When it comes down to it, I'm so 
nervous that my teeth are chattering.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.930
Yikes! You're becoming a 
weird character, Matsu!

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.800
It's okay, Komatsu!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.740
You can do this! Have confidence!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:59.780
Show your strength to the whole world!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.810
Toriko-san...

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.480
My partner is Toriko-san!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.350
So I've got to have confidence 
and take on the challenge!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:13.160
From the bottom of my stomach, I wish to see

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.290
a number of superlative, delicious battles,

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.630
the kind that become deeply etched 
on my tongue and in my mind forever,

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.000
befitting the milestone of this festival.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.570
I wish you all the best of luck.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.470
Thank you, Judge Patch!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.640
And now, just a moment before 
the preliminary round begins.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.710
Please wait a moment.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.710
Are you Chef Komatsu?

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.480
I've been looking forward to meeting you.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.350
Chef Wabutora, the Oil Artisan!

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:45.090
The Mors Oil you discovered 
is wonderful stuff.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:48.790
I use it at my restaurant 
with deep-fried food.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:49.960
I'm grateful to you.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.960
Thank you!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:56.700
Although I didn't find 
the oil all on my own...

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:04.040
A-Anyway, this is an honor!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.510
I read all of your books, Chef Wabutora.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.180
I've already reserved a 
copy of your latest work,

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.050
<i>You and Me are Like Oil and Water</i>.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.090
Well, thank you.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.690
Granny Kama, Miso Soup Hag
54th place in the World Chef Ranking

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.790
I use Mors OIl all the time too.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.890
Granny Kama, the Miso Soup Hag!

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.330
All I have to do is add 
one drop to my miso soup

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:28.530
and it gives it a nice subtle flavor.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.070
S-Scary...

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:41.010
I was more impressed with the 
Medicinal Mochi than Mors Oil.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.980
I'm happy to get the chance 
to meet you, Chef Komatsu.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:49.190
If I'd been there during 
the Four-Beasts fiasco,

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.120
you might've been able to make twice as much.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:54.890
You know, Medicinal Mochi!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.370
Only twice as much, Ton?

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:07.210
If I'd been there, we would've cranked 
out three or four times as much.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:09.010
Nerimaru, Tough Stuff Udon
56th place in the World Chef Ranking

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:12.580
You say you cook faster than 
me, even with that bulky body?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.010
Nerimaru, you're talking in your sleep!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.380
In fact, you're always sleeping when we meet.

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.550
Your eyes are closed anyway.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.490
They're not closed!

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.360
They're just narrow!

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:25.460
Now they're open.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.430
They were open before too!

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:33.000
Just because someone can cook 
fast doesn't mean it's good.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:40.410
Master Kamizaru, the Soba Sage!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:45.540
Kamizaru, the Soba Sage
34th place in the World Chef Ranking

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.640
If you seek speed,

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:51.720
it's difficult

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.190
to bring out the deep flavor.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.520
Certainly, you have a deep face!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:02.490
Right. That face is really persuasive.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:09.270
U-Um, can I have your autograph, everyone?

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:10.300
That's a lot of autograph boards!

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.540
Oh, to be young again...

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.780
Right,

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:20.850
Zau-chan?

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.850
The next generation...

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:28.850
Do you think it's about time for us 
to pass them the baton, Setsu-san?

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.960
You mean retire?

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:34.330
Chefs don't have that 
word in their vocabulary.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:38.600
Just as customers never retire from eating.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.800
Supposedly, Froese-sama, the partner 
of the Gourmet God, Acacia-sama,

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.770
was found gripping a knife

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:50.110
and facing a cutting board in the end.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:54.380
A chef retires

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.910
when they die.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:09:00.520
In that case, we can't let these 
young'uns have it just yet...

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.890
The title of "Super Cook".

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:09.130
I don't intend to let you have it either.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:13.460
After all, the years you won,

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:17.670
I was too busy to participate.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.570
Then shall we settle it between 
us this year, Setsu-san?

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:23.340
I was hoping you'd say that!

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:32.450
Sparks are already flying between the chefs!

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:36.290
Have they started preparing for battle?!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.130
Because of what's been happening,

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:44.630
there are a lot of new 
faces among the top 100.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.270
But the crowd's favorites are the same.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.770
Gourmet Living Legend Setsuno 
and the Cooking King, Zaus.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:57.710
Oh? Is Chef Brunch absent again this year?

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:00.240
You love long shots, Mr. Patch.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.910
Who do you see winning?

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.650
A long shot, eh? Of course, I have one...

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:08.490
One of the newcomers.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:12.490
Now, without further ado, let's go!

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:14.530
We'll start with the preliminary round!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:15.590
Already?!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.630
It's a gourmet endurance race made 
up of swimming, biking, and running!

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.930
We call it Triathlon Cooking!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.270
Triathlon?! Why?!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.310
In this very, very hard Gourmet Age,

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.010
physical strength is 
essential, even for chefs!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:36.280
Now the chefs can display 
the strength they've honed

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.080
on a daily basis!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.420
I haven't done any honing like that...

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.090
That's what I'm talkin' about!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.720
Alright! Just what I wanted to hear!

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.190
50 chefs out of 100 will 
be cut during this round.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:48.690
That is, they'll be out of the competition!

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:50.430
50% will be cut?!

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.760
Now let's move to the location 
for the first battle,

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:56.330
the preliminary round that 
is Triathlon Cooking!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:12.380
It's called a triathlon, but the 
battle really comes down to cooking.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:16.050
Then are chefs who aren't 
physically strong gonna be okay?

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.290
It starts with swimming.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:25.860
They swim from Rice Beach to the halfway 
point Takoyaki Island, get ingredients,

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:29.170
then ride on a bike with the ingredients.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.640
They'll make their way

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:35.310
through Frozen Tofu Wilderness 
that's like freeze-dried tofu.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:37.910
Then they run,

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:42.180
going through Rock Candy Mountain 
Pass, which has countless thin thorns.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:45.880
They get their cooking utensils 
from the steep Bonito Hill,

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.920
and if they make it to the 
cooking station at the goal,

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.420
they begin cooking.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:53.320
There, the 50 chefs who make 
the most delicious food

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:54.990
clear the preliminary round.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.560
So the competition isn't 
just about speed, huh?

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.730
Of course.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:02.730
Though, the faster ones have the advantage 
of picking more delicious ingredients.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.000
Then slower contestants like Matsu

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:08.210
will have to make up for it 
with their cooking technique.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:11.340
Well, chefs in the Gourmet Age

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.850
need to have a certain amount 
of physical strength, right?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:17.820
Hey! Why the hell are you chowin' down?!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.450
Now! Our live report, please!

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.790
Hello!

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:31.900
I'm reporting to you live from 
Cooking Island's famous Rice Beach.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:34.370
Look at this white sand!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.340
It's actually grains of rice!

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.300
A heaping helping!

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.410
50th CF Triathlon Cooking

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:49.450
Triathlon Cooking will start 
here, from Rice Beach!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.350
I can't do this...

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.190
I'm sure I'll be cut this round.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.720
Toriko-san, please lend me your strength!

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.360
Toriko...

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.630
Watchin' Zebra eat made me hungry!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:07.970
This is delish!

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:11.270
Hey! Keep the dishes comin'!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.300
Those two...

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.640
The one who'll give the signal to start

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.010
is this man!

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:21.980
At an impressive 2,715th place 
in the World Chef Ranking?

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:26.750
Dope! That's 2,714th place!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:31.420
From Sushi Fortunetelling, the 
sushi artisan, Chef Monchy!

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.220
Who is he?

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.090
Why Monchy?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.330
Don't you look down on me, dolt!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.900
Chef Monchy, please come on stage.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:43.330
I got it, dumbass!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.510
And they're off!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.950
The curtain has risen on 
the 50th Cooking Festival!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:42.960
Crap!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.670
The fest has already started!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.350
It's started!

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.190
Go, Granny Setsu!

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:09.850
Zaus!

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.020
Fight, Chef Komatsu!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.220
It started!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.690
Matsu!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.390
You better not lose!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:32.440
Good luck, Koma-chan and Miss Sumire!

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:44.360
The spectators are very excited too!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:47.360
I bet this passion and excitement

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.860
is being felt around the world!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:54.330
What a delicious moment the start 
of the preliminary round is!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.740
The TV ratings for the 49th festival

00:15:57.740 --> 00:16:02.170
were an amazing 95%!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.740
The whole world is watching this hot battle

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.850
between the chefs!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.750
The chefs are all starting to swim at once!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:13.120
They have to swim about 1.5 kilometers!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:18.190
That's 750 meters and back 
from Takoyaki Island!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:22.960
Alright, pulling ahead of the pack is 
the pioneer of undersea restaurants,

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.460
Mami!

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:28.230
His seafood-specializing Gourmet 
Hunter partner is Marky,

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:32.240
but he's also a top chef 
who catches fish himself!

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.470
Marble Tuna, Dragon King Shell,

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.080
Flower Salmon, Deep Sea Mammoth, Snow Shrimp,

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.910
Sugar Jellyfish, Red Tide Wine!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:44.480
For people who only love seafood,

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.720
it's a Full Course of which 
they can't get enough!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:57.930
Oh my! Now Wabutora, the Oil 
Artisan, has pulled ahead!

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.770
Plum Oil Natto, Oily Sardines,

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.830
Low-fat Clams, Oily Beef,

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.400
Oil Chicken, Olive Tomato,

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.940
Rice Flour Dumpling Oil, Golden Grease!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:11.240
It's the perfect thick, oily Full Course!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:14.310
He really must have oil flowing in his veins!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.180
No, blood.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.750
The rest of the pack is 
desperately trying to catch up!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:22.350
That's because they choose ingredients 
in the order they arrive on the island!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:32.030
Uh-oh! Chef Komatsu is 
lagging way, way behind!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.000
Is he just slow or is he drowning?!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.340
Yeesh...

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:41.310
Matsu swims like a brick!

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.240
Uh-oh...

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:45.310
Come to think of it, when we 
were after the Puffer Whale,

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:48.410
that guy couldn't swim at all.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.990
Voice Life Jacket.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.630
Get swimmin', kid!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.830
Zebra-san!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.500
Thank you!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:08.600
Alright! If I have this...

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.570
What's this?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.040
You seem to be okay, Komatsu-kun.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.040
Setsuno-san!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.480
I came back because I 
thought you were drowning.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.110
Well...

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.520
Setsuno-san?!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.080
Are you floating on top of the water?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.650
Nope, nothing like that.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:32.190
Yes, you are! You're 100% floating!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.060
No, no. Look closely.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:40.900
Before one foot sinks down, I lift it 
up and put the other foot down, is all.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.330
And then keep repeating.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.300
I see...

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.810
I mean, that's impossible!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.040
W-What is that superhuman feat?!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:51.580
Anyway,

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:54.880
as long as you're alright, 
I'm going on ahead.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.150
After all, we're rivals here at the fest!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.890
It's a fair and square fight, Komatsu-kun!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:11.860
Fast...

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:18.070
Alright! I'm not going to lose either!

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:22.370
It's a fair and square fight, Komatsu-kun!

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.140
That's right...

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.910
This is the Cooking Festival.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.850
This is a precious opportunity,

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:34.450
where even I can seriously compete 
against Setsuno-san and the others!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.090
Zebra-san!

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.330
Please take off this life jacket!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.800
I'm going to fight fair and square,

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.900
with only my own strength!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:50.970
Komatsu...

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.410
Suit yourself.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:56.540
In the first place,

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:03.720
I don't give a damn whether you win or lose.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:11.460
That is,

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.660
unless you become my partner...

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.930
Alright!

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:17.430
Here I go!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.900
Wait for me, Setsuno-san!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.070
Go, dammit!

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.340
Gettin' cocky...

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.110
Komatsu...

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.280
I know you'll be alright!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.980
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:16.820
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:22.290
Only a smile has no flavor, 
so wipe your tears

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:28.730
After a downpour of rain from the 
sky, the sun always rises high

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:34.470
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:40.010
My heart races and I become captivated

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:49.050
Don’t give up! I’m closest to 
you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:53.590
Always believe in yourself!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.140
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:08.670
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.670 --> 00:22:16.210
Hiding Level: 22

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:11.810
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 22.

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:13.810
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:16.010
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:22.250
Okay, where could Yun be?

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:29.090
Yun is... right here!

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:45.140
Have Gourmet Corp.'s agents 
even gotten to this segment?!

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:47.510
Don't look away even one gram

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:50.180
from the Cooking Fest's next developments!

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:54.000
A troublemaker of unprecedented porportions!

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.200
He's the biggest, worst thug ever, but, he's a super first-rate chef!

00:22:58.420 --> 00:23:01.580
Enter Legendary Chef Brunch the Tengu!

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:03.880
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
